 in December 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The high ratio of contracts just under the limit does not prove improper conduct. It could reflect market conditions or budget constraints. Legitimate reasons, like fixed prices or separate needs, might explain the numbers.\nWhat can be checked: Check if multiple contracts cover the same need. Review awardee A's contracts for patterns. Examine contract [1] for details on the service or supply it covers.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["g5M0mkzbesy7JOCXkOhcDg%3D%3D","HjIzrTeLCyOFQ%2FlhRK79lA%3D%3D","kR1emyXUNDnua%2Fi14w%2FPLA%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-16"}}